      "artist": "Rjcastillo",
      "description": "Tribute to the Chilean workers of the time.\nOn December 21, events occurred at the San Lorenzo office that culminated in the tragic massacre of the Santa María de Iquique School, which constituted one of the most emblematic milestones of the Chilean labor movement. The mediation of the government during the strike, its massiveness and its fatal outcome, gave a special connotation to the conflict, in addition to deeply affecting the nitrate activity.",
